{"id":"2b5fd71565e3ae98","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-metric-hausdorff-topology.md","title":"ZFC Metric Hausdorff Topology","display":"df-zfc-metric-hausdorff-topology — ZFC Metric Hausdorff Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-metric-hausdorff-topology","aliases":["58-df-zfc-metric-hausdorff-topology"],"display":"df-zfc-metric-hausdorff-topology — ZFC Metric Hausdorff Topology","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-metric-hausdorff-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-metric-hausdorff-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-metric-hausdorff-topology — ZFC Metric Hausdorff Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHausdorffTopology}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHausdorffTopology}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}topology} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHausdorffTopology}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(d,X\\times X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\\bigl(\n(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=0\\leftrightarrow x=y)\\land\nd(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=d(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\land\nd(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\leq d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)+d(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\land\n\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;\n(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}topology} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHausdorffTopology}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(d,X\\times X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\\bigl(\n(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=0\\leftrightarrow x=y)\\land\nd(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=d(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\land\nd(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\leq d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)+d(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\land\n\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;\n(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The metric axioms and ball-generated topology are expanded, so the Hausdorff clause is tied to an actual metric rather than an uninterpreted topology generator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHausdorffTopology}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}topology} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHausdorffTopology}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(d,X\\times X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\\bigl(\n(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=0\\leftrightarrow x=y)\\land\nd(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=d(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\land\nd(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\leq d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)+d(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\land\n\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)<\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;\n(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1402,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2686","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-metric-hausdorff-topology.md|58-df-zfc-metric-hausdorff-topology]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}